==== Installation using the serial console ====
CFE expects the WFI to be digitally signed. However, since the signature is unknown, the only way to install images on this device is by flashing them with an initramfs image with the following steps:

<WRAP center round alert 60%>
 <color #ed1c24>**Warning: this procedure can brick your device**</color>
</WRAP>

  - Break into CFE console:
    * Power off the device.
    * Start pressing the reset button.
    * Power on the device without releasing the reset button.
    * Wait until CFE command line appears: <WRAP bootlog>
